{"tool_name":"bigwarp","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>Bigwarp is a tool for manual, interactive, landmark-based deformable image alignment. It uses the <a href=\"https://imagej.net/BigDataViewer\">BigDataViewer</a> for visualization and navigation, and uses a <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thin_plate_spline\">Thin Plate Spline</a> implemented <a href=\"https://github.com/saalfeldlab/bigwarp/\">in Java</a> to build a deformation from point correspondences.</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>Bigwarp is a tool for manual, interactive, landmark-based deformable image alignment. It uses the <a href=\"https://imagej.net/BigDataViewer\">BigDataViewer</a> for visualization and navigation, and uses a <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thin_plate_spline\">Thin Plate Spline</a> implemented <a href=\"https://github.com/saalfeldlab/bigwarp/\">in Java</a> to build a deformation from point correspondences.</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2023-03-06T14:02:28+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2018-01-28T10:29:20+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1517135360,"last_comment_uid":284,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"John Bogovic"}],"has_biological_terms":[],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[],"has_function":[{"target_id":4055,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"http://edamontology.org/operation_Image_registration","url":"/image-registration"},{"target_id":4028,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"http://edamontology.org/operation__RCPVGO34XrwrJasQ5yWBg9k","url":"/deformable-registration"},{"target_id":4036,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"http://edamontology.org/operation_Warping","url":"/warping"}],"has_impl